# Licenses & Attribution

This repository contains code with different open-source and noncommercial licenses depending on the component.

---

## 1. Core Kernel Driver & Utilities (`PhxBringup.kext`, `phxctl`)

The core silicon bringup driver (`PhxBringup.kext`), registers, IP discovery, and command submission logic are licensed under the **GNU General Public License v2.0** (GPL-2.0-only) or MIT License, compatible with the upstream Linux `amdgpu` driver components they interface with.

Copyright (c) 2026 luuumi-dev and contributors.

---

## 2. Accelerator & Display Controller (`PhxAccel` / `src/phxaccel`)

The `PhxAccel` kernel extension, framebuffer interface (`PhxAMDFB`), display timing controller (`PhxAGDC`), and `NVMTLDriver` window server patches are derived from NullMoth's driver architecture and are licensed under the **PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0**.

**Required Notice:**
```
NullMoth NVIDIA driver for macOS
Copyright (c) 2026 NullMoth Systems.
SPDX-License-Identifier: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
```

> **Commercial Use Prohibited:** Under the terms of the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, you may not use this software for any commercial purpose (any purpose intended for or directed towards commercial advantage or monetary compensation).

Full text of the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0:
https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0/

